{"headword":"לוּחַ","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m. tablet, board</strong> or <strong>plank, plate (</strong>NH <em>id.</em>, Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">לוּחָא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܠܘܽܚܳܐ</span>; Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">لَوْحٌ</span> (mod. pron. <em>lûḥ, lôḥ</em>, cf. e.g. Spiro<sup>Arabic-Eng. Vocab.</sup> Buhl), Ethiopic ለውሕ, but Assyrian <em>lêʾu</em> (as if from <span dir=\"rtl\">לחה</span> in Dl<sup>HWB 366</sup>; see, however, <em>lêjum (lêyum)</em> Jäger<sup>BAS i, 486</sup><strong>)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ל׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.8\">Is 30:8</a>; cstr. <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 3:3\" href=\"/Proverbs.3.3\">Pr 3:3</a> + 4 times; du. <span dir=\"rtl\">לֻחֹתָ֑יִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.5\">Ez 27:5</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">לוּחֹת (לֻחוֹת)</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לֻחֹת</span>) abs. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 32:16\" href=\"/Exodus.32.16\">Ex 32:16</a> + 17 times; cstr. <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:13\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.13\">Dt 4:13</a> + 16 times;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"chiefly of stone tablets on which ten words were written <a data-ref=\"Exodus 24:12\" href=\"/Exodus.24.12\">Ex 24:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 31:18\" href=\"/Exodus.31.18\">31:18b</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 32:16\" href=\"/Exodus.32.16\">32:16</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 32:19\" href=\"/Exodus.32.19\">19</a> (all E), <a data-ref=\"Exodus 34:1\" href=\"/Exodus.34.1\">34:1</a><sup>(×3)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 34:4\" href=\"/Exodus.34.4\">4</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 34:28\" href=\"/Exodus.34.28\">28</a> (all J), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:13\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.13\">Dt 4:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 5:17\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.5.17\">5:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 9:9\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.9.9\">9:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 9:10\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.9.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 9:11\" href=\"/Deuteronomy